    satisfy CargoDeliveryRequirement by STS123IntegratedSystem::dextre;
    satisfy CrewSafetyRequirement by STS123IntegratedSystem::orbiter;
    satisfy TelemetryRequirement by STS123IntegratedSystem::missionControl;
    satisfy EVARequirement by STS123IntegratedSystem::crew;

    exhibit state STS123MissionStateMachine by STS123IntegratedSystem;

    perform action LaunchAndAscent by STS123IntegratedSystem::orbiter;
    perform action RendezvousAndDock by STS123IntegratedSystem;
    perform action TransferKiboLogisticsModule by STS123IntegratedSystem;
    perform action InstallDextreManipulator by STS123IntegratedSystem;
    perform action ConductEVAOperations by STS123IntegratedSystem::crew;
    perform action UndockAndReturn by STS123IntegratedSystem::orbiter;
